    Now given a new goal description: Make toast and place it on the desk in the living room., Boil water in the kettle and place it on the desk in the living room., Heat the pot using the induction and place it on the desk in the living room., Wash the clothes in the washing machine and place them back in the bedroom., Cook cup ramen using the water dispenser and place it on the desk in the living room., Heat the food in the microwave and place it on the desk in the living room., Charge the phone in the bedroom and place it on the desk in the living room., Place the water bottle from the kitchen onto the desk in the living room., Wipe the desk in the living room using the dishcloth., Turn on the light switch in the specified room., Turn off the light switch in the specified room., Organize all the dishes by placing them onto the shelf in the kitchen., Store the eggs in the egg container in the kitchen.,
