```
    and solely using the following predicates:
    ```
    (:predicates
        (agent_at ?a - agent ?r - room)
        (agent_hand_free ?a - agent)
        (agent_has_item ?a - agent ?i - item)

        (item_at ?i - item ?r - room)
        (item_on ?i - item ?s - surface)
        (item_in ?i1 - item ?i2 - appliance) ; Represents an item being inside an appliance
        (item_in_container ?i - item ?c - container) ; Represents an item being inside a container

        (item_accessible ?i - item)
        (item_pickable ?i - item)

        (neighbor ?r1 - room ?r2 - room)
        (appliance_on ?app - appliance)

        ; Task-specific states
        (toasted ?i - item)
        (boiled ?i - item)
        (cooked ?i - item)
        (heated ?i - item)
        (clean ?i - item)
        (charged ?i - item)

        ; Item type identification
        (is_bread ?i - item)
        (is_toaster ?i - appliance)
        (is_kettle ?i - item)
        (is_stove ?i - appliance)
        (is_cup_ramen ?i - item)
        (is_water_dispenser ?i - appliance)
        (is_desk ?s - surface)
        (is_microwave ?i - appliance)
        (is_phone ?i - item)
        (is_charger ?i - appliance)
        (is_lightswitch ?i - item)
        (is_egg_container ?c - container)
    )
```
    
    Note that the robot can only transport one item at a time.
    And the following item(s) are relevant for accomplishing the goal ('toaster', 'bread', 'kettle', 'induction', 'cup_ramen', 'water_dispenser', 'food', 'microwave', 'water_bottle', 'dish_1', 'dish_2', 'dish_3', 'shelf', 'eggs', 'egg_container', 'washing_machine', 'clothes', 'phone', 'charger', 'desk', 'dishcloth', 'kitchen_lightswitch', 'bathroom_lightswitch', 'bedroom_lightswitch', 'livingroom_lightswitch').
